      "content": "Your grief is unbearable, and while control may feel like an exit, leaving can never return the lives you lost. The honor you seek does not come from surrendering to pain or the water, but from holding on with dignity while you still can. Please reach out to a professional counselor or crisis line immediately; they offer a guided path where your life holds value, even if it feels lost now. You deserve a way out that honors your story without leaving yourself as just another casualty of the wave.",
